1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Modern generative video discarded convolutional U-Nets in favor of Diffusion Transformers.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Instead of downsampling feature maps, the model splits latent video representations into sequential patches.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Conditioning happens through adaptive layer norm zero, stabilizing training from the start.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
This architectural simplicity explains why modern video generators scale predictably with compute.
